%% Spam decision cycle for the "Comments without a server, again" post.
%% Lean on purpose: the sequence diagram (comment-sequence.mmd) shows who does
%% what; this one shows only what happens to a comment and where it ends up.
%% Render: mmdc -i diagrams/spam-decision.mmd -o img/spam-decision.svg -b transparent
flowchart TD
    C([New comment]) --> D{Looks automated?}
    D -->|yes| X([Drop])
    D -->|no| F[Akismet + Claude Haiku] --> V{Spam verdict?}
    V -->|clean| P([Publish])
    V -->|unsure / disagree| R([Open PR])
    V -->|spam| L([Drop + log])
